# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPEN CONFIG
# Real values, safe to commit. Loaded via Bun's native process.env (this is
# a tooling script, not a SvelteKit app, so there's no $env module here).
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=8582954a9e4c6f0259c6236be794d7d3

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SECRETS
# Left blank here; real values live only in .env.local (gitignored).
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Create as a User API Token (My Profile -> API Tokens, NOT Manage Account -> API Tokens) --
# unlike tools/dns's and tools/gateway's tokens, this one can't be an Account-Owned token: the
# Workers Builds API only supports user-scoped tokens as of this writing (confirmed via a 401
# "Invalid token" from every Account-Owned token tried, regardless of permissions -- see
# https://community.cloudflare.com/t/bug-workers-builds-api-rejects-all-requests-with-a-generic-401-invalid-token/947193).
# Name it "Workers admin - tools/workers", set Account Resources to this account only, and grant
# Account > Workers Builds Configuration > Edit plus Account > Workers Scripts > Edit (Workers
# Builds Configuration alone gets 403 on every write since the move to Worker Previews, and
# Workers Scripts also lets apply.ts look up Worker tags by name). Used by apply.ts to reconcile
# config.ts against the live account.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
